WEBVTT

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.770
"EPISODE 9
THE PRETTY BOY TRAVELING
WITH THE BROCADE PORTRAIT (PART 2)"

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.570
Such an uncomely posture, maidservant.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:56.530
"REUNION WITH THE DEMON"

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:56.530
Such an uncomely posture, maidservant.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.160
"KODAKI KAWAIKE

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.500
You shouldn't, miss.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.710
If you use such filthy language,
you'll get yourself censored!

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.420
"MAYUMI DOJIMA"

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.420
If you use such filthy language,
you'll get yourself censored!

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:11.250
Shut up.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:15.920
I heard you called me things like
"zashiki-warashi" and "yokai," too.

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.260
How'd she find out?

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:22.220
Can our student council president be putting me
and Kodaki in conflict without warning,

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:25.890
in an effort to nurture our friendship?

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:29.520
Huh? What's wrong, shade-dweller?
Staring at me like that...

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.650
You got something you want to say?

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.900
Something I want to say, or more like...

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:38.860
That hagoita was really awesome.
Did you make it, Kodaki?

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:43.740
Can you tell me how you made it,
and how you carried it over while you're at it?

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.330
Hagoita? Huh? What're you talking about?

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.710
She didn't fall for it.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.340
Yurika, did you come here by yourself?

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.090
What the hell is Yurika?

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:59.090
Oh, you know, because you're
really pretty when you walk.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:00.930
"Walks like a lily," was the—

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.680
What the? What kind of
emotion is she expressing?

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.720
Fine.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.940
I'll take back how I said
you had uncomely posture.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.820
Hold on. In the first place,
Kodaki was the one who first approached me.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:18.280
Doesn't that mean
she has something she wants from me?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.450
Huh? I don't want anything from you.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:24.450
Don't be so conceited, whore.
I just came here to look at that face of yours.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.830
My face?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.490
When I passed by you yesterday,

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:33.130
I didn't realize you were the new kid
in the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:37.300
Is that group so great that you want
to cross-dress just to be a part of it?

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:43.390
It probably feels good to be surrounded
by handsome guys and get pampered by them.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.260
Does it seem that way after all?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:49.270
I don't want that hagoita so throw it away.
Tell that to Manabu.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.310
And die.

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:06.030
Why did our leader refuse
Kodaki's request to join the club?

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:08.240
"MUSIC ROOM"

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:26.720
Please do three sets of this training
every morning and every night.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.430
Now, shall we head over
to the art room?

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.100
"NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI"

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.100
Now, shall we head over
to the art room?

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.730
"NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI"

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.730
Miss Mayumi, did you work on
the homework our leader gave you?

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.520
Miss Mayumi, did you work on
the homework our leader gave you?

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:37.650
How did things go on your end, Sakiguchi?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:38.940
Well...

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:44.950
I visited her at her home, but unfortunately
I couldn't see her in person.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.660
So I tried speaking to her on the phone,
but I made no progress.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.080
She's only a first-grader, after all.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.540
There are limits on how long
I can speak on the phone,

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.460
so it ended up being a text conversation.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.170
Even then, I stopped
hearing from her by 10:00 PM.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.920
I just saw her over there.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:07.050
Why didn't you say so earlier?

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:11.180
Sakiguchi, what kind of girl is she, really?

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:16.190
What happened between her and the Pretty
Boy Detective Club this past summer?

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:23.530
Perhaps we've been giving you the feeling
of being left out from yesterday.

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:28.450
Since I'm having you become
Miss Kodaki's first friend,

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.030
I suppose I cannot stay silent about this.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.000
The demon's first friend?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.210
"THE DEMON'S BIRTH"

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.460
"(A NOVEL BY SEISHI YOKOMIZO)"

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.460
Ladies and gentlemen.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.750
Now, where shall I begin this story?

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.970
I guess I'll start with
Miss Kodaki Kawaike's ancestry.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.930
When I first met Miss Kodaki,

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:54.430
she was a lovely little girl who could be called
a "little lady" with little hindrance.

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:59.520
I do hope that all your misunderstandings
will be cleared with today's talk.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.150
In my eyes, she is,
no matter how you look at it,

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.150
simply a fiancée who my parents chose for me.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.910
She is nothing more than
a fiancée who my parents chose.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:13.580
This is rather tragic for Miss Kodaki.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.040
But because of being born into that life,

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:23.500
that's not the reason why she insults others
by calling them "pauper" or "peasant."

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.510
Much of the mockery that comes from her

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:30.640
has its separate roots from
such emotions of discrimination.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:37.640
Because the Kawaike family was already withering
before she was old enough to create memories.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:45.780
I have doubts on phrasing it this way,
but she is what you call fallen nobility.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:50.360
By the way, the kimono that you saw her wearing
is like a reminder of her nobility.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.870
A memento of her late mother who passed away
after so much mental exhaustion.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.330
An heirloom that she still owns.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.910
So because of those circumstances,

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:02.750
she was forced into a situation that might've
put her on the streets at a young age.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:08.340
However, the Kawaike family is an old, honorable
family, and because of its "tradition,"

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.800
there was a reason why it would be
troublesome if they were to fall.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.470
For society as a whole.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:18.390
For example, when a giant corporation
goes bankrupt, help comes from various places

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:21.650
so there isn't damage from
a chain reaction of bankruptcies.

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:25.860
Similarly, the Kawaike family
barely managed to survive.

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:27.820
The specific step they took

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:31.950
was to create a matrimonial relationship
with the Sakiguchi family.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.280
That's right.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.580
There was not a shred
of a romantic relationship,

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:39.330
let alone the jests of having a lolita complex.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:44.000
It was simply a traditional
marriage of convenience.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.380
Wasn't I able to refuse, you ask?

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:50.340
I'm aware of the situation I'm placed in.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:53.890
If the Kawaike family can have
a resurgence before I turn eighteen,

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.350
there would be no problems.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:59.600
No matter how much I speak with restraint,
I have led a blessed life.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.940
I felt that helping others to that extent
was part of my responsibility.

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.150
That was a grave mistake.

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:11.280
I was not the only one
who had harbored a sense of responsibility.

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:16.280
Miss Kodaki believed that
everything was resting on her shoulders.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:20.040
I'm sure you can imagine
how things unfolded from there.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:22.000
Her passionate approaches began,

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:27.130
and she caused hindrances not only to my private
life, but also to my student council activities.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:31.170
That led to the trouble
from this past summer.

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:36.550
That's right, I'm talking about the summer
training camp for the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:39.220
The schedules ended up clashing.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:44.270
Since I'm not a lolicon, I tried to prioritize
the training camp, of course.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.020
But that's not how the dice rolled.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:50.230
The demon wouldn't allow that.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.690
For her, since she's trying
to protect her family name,

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:55.660
the Pretty Boy Detective Club
that's preventing her prenuptial trip

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.950
must've looked like an evil syndicate.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:03.580
That said, Miss Kodaki
did not initially oppose the Club.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:08.420
She first attempted
to join the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.800
If the vacation plans clashed,

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:15.930
she simply thought that
she can just go with us on this trip.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:20.560
Yes. Just as I previously mentioned,
that idea reached a standstill.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:24.640
Our leader personally and flatly refused.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:29.020
No, I didn't harbor
any doubts about that back then

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:33.150
as we are quite literally
the "Pretty Boy Detective Club."

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:38.570
The fact that women couldn't join was something
all members thought, "Well, of course."

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:44.410
And so, when your request to join was accepted
later on, it was an unexpected surprise.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.210
Would it have been fine
simply by cross-dressing?

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:51.920
If it was something so simple, then Miss Kodaki
would've been beyond redemption.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.760
But with that said,
there's no room for sympathy.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:10:02.720
Because Miss Kodaki, after being refused entry,
took strong measures as her Plan B.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:07.770
You had mentioned this too, but you know
how she walks without a single footstep sound?

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:13.320
She can walk up to you from behind without
being noticed, like she did to you earlier?

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.990
In a similar manner, Miss Kodaki,
at the end of the first trimester,

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:23.040
approached our leader from behind him
in the elementary school building,

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:27.960
and shoved him off the stairs
by pushing his defenseless back.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:36.510
Fortunately, our leader didn't suffer
any serious wounds, but he had hurt his leg.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:40.510
The cancellation of the summer
training camp was inevitable.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:44.770
Our leader covered for Miss Kodaki
and said, "My foot just slipped,"

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.980
so it didn't become an issue.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.770
Perhaps she reflected upon her actions
and felt she had gone too far,

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:55.150
as Miss Kodaki never again tried to approach
the Pretty Boy Detective Club ever since.

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.820
Until yesterday.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.240
Until yesterday?

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.410
Yes.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:03.030
There's no doubt that your appearance

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.500
as a new member became
the trigger for Miss Kodaki.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:13.090
That's why I have this foolish thought that
it'd be nice for you to become her friend.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.880
I see. So that's what it was.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:19.130
When I carefully listen
to the story like this...

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:23.180
When I carefully listen to the story like this,
I see she has her circumstances.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:25.810
Her circumstances...

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.480
My impression of her doesn't change much.

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:35.570
In fact, the simple feeling that
she's trouble has actually increased.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:38.780
I can understand that all the insults

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:42.780
mocking "the common folk" came from
a complicated inferiority complex.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:45.530
But that doesn't mean such
behavior should be forgiven,

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.370
and I wasn't really moved by the story.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.870
Unfortunately for you, Yurika, I'm scummy.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:58.510
But because you're such scum, that's why
I felt you could be Miss Kodaki's first friend.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.050
I cannot help but to anticipate that.

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.970
D-Don't say so plainly that I'm scum.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:10.060
By the way, why was the demon denied,
but this scum was allowed to join?

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:14.100
Did you ever find an answer to
that question within yourself, Sakiguchi?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:18.940
No. I didn't take the time to
confirm that with our leader, either.

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:22.240
I'm sure he has very
deep thoughts concerning it.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.490
Oh, right.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:30.160
The reason you think Kodaki brought in the
hagoita to the art room without permission...

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:34.210
Is it okay to assume it's because
she wanted it sent back to her?

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:38.590
Yes. In other words, a childish ploy
to establish a fait accompli

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:43.010
such as "receiving a gift from my fiancé."

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:44.640
But is that childish?

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.640
If I recall, sending a hagoita

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.350
was a tradition for the
first new year after a baby girl is born.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.770
By creating such foreshadowing,
did she create a situation

00:12:55.770 --> 00:13:01.240
for Sakiguchi to easily send a gift
to have him think, "while I'm at it"?

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:05.950
If that was part of the work to remove obstacles
barring the way for her fiancé only in name,

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:09.660
then there's a maliciousness there
that I can't quite say is childish.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:15.460
The presentations proceeded basically
along the lines of what I expected.

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:16.960
"MANABU SOTOIN"

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:16.960
Sotoin spoke about his absurd theory,

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.960
Sotoin spoke about his absurd theory,

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:19.960
"HYOTA ASHIKAGA"

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:19.960
then Mr. Bare-Legs
gave his brute-force theory,

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.210
then Mr. Bare-Legs
gave his brute-force theory,

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.970
"SOSAKU YUBIWA"

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.970
while Mr. Genius stayed quiet
and didn't say a word,

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.680
"MICHIRU FUKUROI"

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.680
followed by Mr. Delinquent,
who gave a very conventional theory.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.720
However...

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:34.060
Without waiting for
my presentation, Mr. Delinquent...

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.350
Haven't we had enough?

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:39.610
How that demon brought the hagoita in here...

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:42.400
It would be easier to just interrogate her.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:48.280
As I said, it would be best to find
the method of transportation

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:51.910
so she would have no room
to make any excuses.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.830
Even if that were to happen,

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.870
and we figured out how she did it,
and shoved the evidence before her,

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:01.960
that demon wouldn't admit to
her crimes nor would she repent.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:05.760
What's required here is
a fundamental solution to the problem.

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:08.470
What are you trying to say, Michiru?

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:11.430
I mean, the root of all this is because

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:16.390
you're continuing this relationship with that
demon even though you're not a lolicon, right?

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:20.230
If you don't feel that way about her,
then shouldn't you just dump her outright?

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:27.030
Michiru, you have to think about
Nagahiro's feelings, too.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.780
He thinks it's too early to do that.

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:35.830
He wants to enjoy being engaged to the devil
until at least she's out of elementary school.

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.620
That's not what I want.
Please stay quiet for a bit.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.000
All right.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.840
I cannot trouble the Club any longer.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:47.380
Besides, I'm at my limit as well.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:52.680
The engagement with Miss Kodaki,
that our parents arranged without our consent...

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.430
I will annul it as of today.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:56.020
"MAYUMI THE SEER"

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:04.320
Nagahiro, are you really all right with that?

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.240
You don't have to do it for my sake.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:10.950
As I've said many times before,
my foot really did just slip.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:18.750
Even if that was true, the fact remains that
Miss Kodaki silently approached you from behind.

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:23.710
As such, I should've
made my decision back then.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:29.300
I shouldn't have been shouldering
the family lineage as a middle school student.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:34.180
I was her fiancé, but I was interacting
with Miss Kodaki like I was her guardian.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.640
And that was a mistake.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:40.190
The second rule of the Club
was "Be a boy," right?

00:15:41.310 --> 00:15:42.560
I see.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:50.990
So, Mayumi, are you really all right with this?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.320
I feel sad for Kodaki.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:57.330
I think he knew that I felt that way.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.290
I honestly don't care
about family lineage and things like that.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:02.210
She's just a girl.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:07.590
Evil, calculating, foolish,
with a twisted personality,

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.090
violent, sharp-tongued, and scheming.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:13.890
There's nothing good about that.
Just a girl who's...

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:15.470
But, even so...

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:21.190
That doesn't mean
I should abandon her, right?

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:25.810
I am Mayumi the Seer after all.

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.570
This is not good, Leader.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:32.780
There's no way that a world
where you can only save

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.740
the people you love or good people
can be beautiful.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.870
It's all right to save a scummy person
that you don't like, right?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.500
Think, think, think, think, think,
think, think, think.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:50.710
The current problem is that
we don't know what Kodaki will do,

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:56.260
but she has the possibility of freely bringing
things in here, no matter how dangerous.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:17:01.730
If we get rid of that possibility, at the least,
we can revert this situation back to zero.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.350
And if we can revert it to that,

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:06.940
it'll no longer be about having to annul
the engagement here and now.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:11.320
Think, think, think, think, think,
think, think, think.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:15.280
There has to be a solution
that conforms to reality.

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.160
There has to be a way
where this human-sized hagoita

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:21.450
can be easily transported by a little girl.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.710
With the thin arms of a first-grader...

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:28.790
Rather, if there was a way
for someone with my strength to transport it...

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:33.920
Those who seek the stars look only to the sky.

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:36.180
But you can never forget.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:41.850
The ground that you see when you
hang your head down can also be a star.

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:45.190
"EPILOGUE"

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.020
Thanks to all the training,

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:52.400
my class 2-B successfully received
the gold award in the choir contest.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.900
That doesn't matter? I know, right?

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:58.160
I'll also add that we didn't
earn the gold award.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:02.290
Yubiwa Academy puts up a front
for fairness and equality,

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:06.500
so the choir contest lacks
common concepts like rankings.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:09.590
Everyone who participated got first place.

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:10.750
Yeah, yeah.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:15.970
And so, regarding the story that actually
matters, starting with the conclusion,

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:22.260
the engagement between Sakiguchi
and Kodaki Kawaike was not annulled.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:27.100
The student council president's suspicion
of being a lolicon has not been cleared yet.

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:33.280
I don't know if that's a good thing or
a bad thing, but the weather is nice today.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:36.110
The one seeking the stars, of course,

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:39.240
is referring to me and my ten years
of continual star-searching.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:42.870
In this case "sky" doesn't mean the heavens.

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:44.290
It's the ceiling.

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.580
Like the equivalent
of the ground and the ceiling,

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.670
if I interpret that
as the floor and the ceiling...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:52.500
It would become the truth
behind this incident.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:58.050
If I were to carve out a portion of the
classroom floor, I could create a large board.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:01.510
The specific location would be under the table.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:05.970
You sneak into the art room when the members
aren't present and cut the carpet apart.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:11.940
Carve the floor, and of course you can't use it
as is, so you sand it and make it shine.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:14.400
The sawdust created
can be discarded under the floor.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:18.150
Well, all right.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.860
Even if we were to present this clear evidence,

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:24.660
I'm sure that Miss Kodaki
still would not admit to her crimes.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:29.670
But if we figured out how,
we can set up a defensive tactic for next time.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:32.750
The demon sure has found a great friend.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.800
Geez, who're you talking about?

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.550
And it seems like I have
gained a good underclassman.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:46.520
Yeah, yeah. I have
a great upperclassman as well...

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:48.060
Mr. Senpai.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.600
Hey, Leader.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:57.650
Why did you deny Kodaki,
but allow me to join the club?

00:19:57.650 --> 00:20:00.860
I would like to correct
a misunderstanding first, Mayumi.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:03.820
I did not get shoved by the
demon.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:07.790
I've said this many times,
but nobody believes me.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.710
Perhaps I lack disposition as the leader.

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:13.210
But wasn't that to cover for Kodaki...

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:18.010
If her presence isn't noticed
even when she's standing right behind you,

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:22.130
and if she suddenly started talking to you,
anyone would be surprised by that.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.310
And the reason why
I denied Kodaki from joining the club?

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.600
That's something ever so
obvious, Mayumi.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.480
We are the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.980
This is no place for a maiden in love.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.740
It wasn't because she was a girl.
It's because she was a maiden.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:48.790
From her heart that was becoming frantic
for the continued existence of her family,

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:52.660
Sotoin could see through passionate
emotions that couldn't be fully hidden.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:56.420
And if that's why he denied Kodaki
from joining the Club,

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:59.130
then that's another tale of aestheticism.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:05.430
However, were those passionate feelings
really aimed at her fiancé?

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:09.060
I don't want that hagoita so throw it away.
Tell that to Manabu.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.600
And die.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.850
Kodaki said, "Tell that to Manabu."

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:17.480
"To Manabu."

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:20.440
The fact that she specified the club president
instead of the vice-president...

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:24.400
How that is interpreted will depend
on the person, of course.

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.820
The person who Kodaki wanted
the hagoita to be returned by...

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:35.000
To interpret that she wanted it sent to her by
our leader would be a twisted minority opinion.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:39.460
If she hadn't pushed him down,
then when she snuck up to him from behind,

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:42.420
what was she going to say?
To theorize that...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.800
...would be just suspicions from a fool.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.350
As a whole, it's nothing
that a detective should do.

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:53.930
It's one thing to be rowdy together
and give advice to her as a bad friend,

00:21:53.930 --> 00:21:55.440
but in this particular case,

00:21:55.440 --> 00:22:00.190
it's definitely not something that
you lower your voice and talk about.

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:05.950
"THE BEGINNING"
